71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ob7YTYr7KOoQ7kNvwEfvQy3&_nc_oc=AdoI3-wVhqufQmcCKyDE2xGW11rdO8Etm_BX1MW-f3q-lLJT_nKqT9jRH_3R2S4uvxU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_liAmD_OGENj4tB6ZFNyc47Sa9KHxfcsQpyF4HS-eG9Q&oe=6A26BF39"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=F8UdcHxeZzEQ7kNvwEVq3IW&_nc_oc=AdolZzUcNm0Lp3a0wycizTf1EIBK2VD4gfZOSJ9y3Va2_s86vV0FEpzqpNNz5Uij3-I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9UQRlK_NdLEG7kPuwLUtRgWW2dGTh6yPC4LUanr3ORFQ&oe=6A26D213"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-_2KvuDPwi0Q7kNvwErZfza&_nc_oc=AdohUBUQObw4Fe_l3hxlWjd4MZrS5tF48AfwvselubbzsQP_NyLBMfBNId2iTg_bF9E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_o1PfLwnq6zIfsocC5wKTcXv2ZK1BhJIJHhzZoIH9RlQ&oe=6A26D05A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: